sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Operator
    participant D as D Redistribution Owner
    participant A as Shared Vehicle Claim
    participant B as B Parking Owner
    participant C as C Charging Owner
    participant U as Shared UnitOfWork
    Operator->>D: previewTransfer(source,destination,vehicles)
    D-->>Operator: previewId, revision, TTL
    Operator->>D: issueOrder(previewId,revision,context)
    D->>U: executeAtomic(issue)
    U->>A: reserve exclusive claim for each vehicle
    U->>C: readPlugAndCharge(vehicle)
    U->>B: reserveTransferCapacity(orderId,vehicles,destination)
    alt all preconditions pass
        U->>D: persist ISSUED order
        U-->>Operator: committed order receipt
    else any conflict or stale data
        U-->>Operator: rollback all resources
    end
    Note over D,B: Physical movement arrives later via D07 per vehicle
    D->>B: recordArrival(verifiedEvent,rightId,context)
    D->>D: mark vehicle delivered once
    Note over D: Order remains IN_PROGRESS until all delivered
